### Service Scheduler API - runnable examples (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:5076

### Reference data
GET {{host}}/api/dealerships

###
GET {{host}}/api/service-types

###
GET {{host}}/api/customers

### Availability: bookable Full Service slots at London on a given local date
GET {{host}}/api/dealerships/1/availability?serviceTypeId=4&date=2026-12-01

### Book an appointment (201 Created). Re-sending with the same Idempotency-Key returns 200 + the original.
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "dealershipId": 1,
  "serviceTypeId": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T09:00:00Z"
}

### Overlapping Full Service for another customer -> 409 no_technician_available
### (Tech C is the only Full Service technician at London)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "vehicleId": 2,
  "dealershipId": 1,
  "serviceTypeId": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### Runs past closing time -> 422 outside_opening_hours
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "vehicleId": 2,
  "dealershipId": 1,
  "serviceTypeId": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T16:00:00Z"
}

### Get / list / cancel
GET {{host}}/api/appointments/1

###
GET {{host}}/api/appointments?dealershipId=1

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/appointments/1

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
